WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:04.462
I'm speaking to you today as
a representative of Monarch.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.591
Monarch is a global
collaboration

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:11.970
of governmental and
scientific agencies

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.681
dedicated to the study
of massive unidentified

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:19.102
terrestrial organisms, or
MUTOs, including the creature

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.312
we know as Godzilla.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.732
Now our mission
is to protect you,

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.525
the citizens around the world.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:29.904
We bring the best minds and the
most cutting-edge technology

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:33.950
to this purpose, including the
early warning system that was

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.618
triggered in Seattle yesterday.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:38.663
Unfortunately, this time,
it was just a false alarm,

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:41.166
and we regret any distress
this may have caused.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.835
But I take great
comfort in knowing

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:47.589
robust systems are in place
to give us ample warning

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.215
in a real emergency.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.015
Listen, I know that
the events of G-Day,

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.391
they rocked the world--

00:00:58.683 --> 00:01:00.435
a world where
everything that we love,

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:02.854
everything that we
hold dear, it just

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:04.230
could be gone in an instant.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:09.694
And let me tell you as a
mother, I share your fear.

00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:12.489
But this is now the
world we live in.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:18.161
Monsters are an inescapable
reality, a constant threat

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:23.625
that we must learn to survive.

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.002
And I believe we can.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:30.298
Together, I believe we will.

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:32.926
That is my commitment to you.

